{"id":"2091409585","kind":"answer","title":"发现一款新的anki软件“滑记”app好用吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-08-29","updated":"2021-08-29","votes":31,"comment_count":10,"minutes":1,"chars":448,"keywords":["间隔重复","记忆卡片","助记媒介","检索练习","卡片设计"],"summary":"还不错吧，名字很有年轻人的特色哈哈！ 之前还收到了滑记送的礼物： 感谢 @滑记 赠送的七夕礼物哈哈， 希望你… 我之前做的 Anki 高考牌组全都上架了： 似乎牌组、卡片、模板全部兼容 Anki，忘记、模糊、记得这三个按钮神似墨墨背单词[doge] 还有自研的 AI(?) 算法 客套话先说到这里，我觉得滑记的当务之急是提升卡片…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/467528132/answer/2091409585","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"e4EhnaPg\">还不错吧，名字很有年轻人的特色哈哈！</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"zQIiEd2W\">之前还收到了滑记送的礼物：</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1409960548762677248\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">感谢 @滑记 赠送的七夕礼物哈哈， 希望你…</a><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"IT7rCR2-\">我之前做的 Anki 高考牌组全都上架了：</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c06852727fe37e2b8b02a42578c1705_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-39dd40d4ad59864b34d382320b7fbf28\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-39dd40d4ad59864b34d382320b7fbf28_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c06852727fe37e2b8b02a42578c1705_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-39dd40d4ad59864b34d382320b7fbf28\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-39dd40d4ad59864b34d382320b7fbf28_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"oe6t5DJg\">似乎牌组、卡片、模板全部兼容 Anki，忘记、模糊、记得这三个按钮神似墨墨背单词[doge]</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d12d72c97a3e372434d14c7be48a290c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-05b82f1e168584c67aa028faff274f19\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-05b82f1e168584c67aa028faff274f19_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d12d72c97a3e372434d14c7be48a290c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-05b82f1e168584c67aa028faff274f19\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-05b82f1e168584c67aa028faff274f19_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"OwOyOTS9\">还有自研的 AI(?) 算法</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c38d5ac0a36d08f4412bffc2287d446d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2fc4dc3ea5a3158f6bd6ae65f6e90050\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2fc4dc3ea5a3158f6bd6ae65f6e90050_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c38d5ac0a36d08f4412bffc2287d446d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2fc4dc3ea5a3158f6bd6ae65f6e90050\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2fc4dc3ea5a3158f6bd6ae65f6e90050_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"828\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"BrT4A4YY\">客套话先说到这里，我觉得滑记的当务之急是提升卡片质量，特别是专业创作者。因为 UGC 上想要胜过 Anki 和 Quizlet 十分困难，但在 PGC 上还有很大的想象空间，正如下面这篇随笔所述：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-a6c4dfe39757c60e167f83bc51f775ab_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"960\" data-image-width=\"1280\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/396445859\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【随笔】间隔重复软件的两大进路</a><p data-pid=\"5ZHCc_HC\">我认为专家编写卡片这条路还道阻且长。哪怕是专家编写的卡片，一上来就让学习者进行记忆，也是非常困难的。</p><p data-pid=\"NS33kJr2\">目前我也在翻译相关文章：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6a2b0e4fc003b06469a79b4d63b2478b_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"800\" data-image-width=\"1200\" data-tm-id=\"397245681\" href=\"#/post/397245681\">叶峻峣：【翻译】写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-0719defcc4bb142f2e523c84cd67cad9_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"720\" data-image-width=\"1280\" data-tm-id=\"399738674\" href=\"#/post/399738674\">叶峻峣：【翻译】间隔重复系统能力的限制因素是写出足够多的好卡片</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-7198a9a918fb97f09757ca579c655dc8_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"787\" data-image-width=\"1280\" data-tm-id=\"398094270\" href=\"#/post/398094270\">叶峻峣：【翻译】高质量的间隔重复记忆卡片最重要的属性是什么？</a><p data-pid=\"lw2pY7jk\">希望滑记越来越好，能把这个业行的实践传统塑造出来，让越来越多的学习者用上间隔重复！</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"398094270","title":"高质量的间隔重复记忆卡片最重要的属性是什么？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":36,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"399738674","title":"间隔重复系统能力的限制因素是写出足够多的好卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":14,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"397245681","title":"写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"397271029","title":"学习别人的间隔重复记忆卡片通常是无效的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"412012134","title":"JAnki：写给程序员们的 13 条 Anki 使用经验","aut